//! Focused tests for the pure core of src/crdt_engine/import_vault_ops.rs:
//! zip parsing (obsidian/notion/roam), title-lookup-key normalization,
//! fnv1aPath determinism, and the import-plan resolution layer — all checked
//! against fixtures generated by the ACTUAL frontend implementation
//! (frontend/scripts/generate-vault-fixtures.test.mts), which builds the same
//! stored zips the parity harness builds.
//!
//! The module is compiled into this test crate via #[path]; the crate-level
//! infrastructure the async handler references (ledger, pending uploads,
//! document/workspace ops) is satisfied by thin shims below, exactly like
//! tests/block_ops.rs. The handler itself needs an AppHandle and is exercised
//! end-to-end by the cell integration suite / parity harness, not this file.

